337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (It is our pleasure to present the final report for ReSwipe. This year has been one of meaningful growth, valuable learning, and proud accomplishments.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
338 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (Goals & Objectives)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
339 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (ReSwipe generated more than $3,000 in revenue across 200+ units sold, with $1,031.81 in net profit after salaries, achieving both our sales and production goal of $3000 and 200 units respectively. Our share value grew from $10.00 to almost $90. We donated 20% of profits to Urban Roots, a London non-profit building equitable, food-secure communities through urban agriculture. We also won Top Pitch at Dragon's Lair.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
340 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (Challenges and Successes)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
341 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (Like any business, we faced challenges. A mid-year product pivot set us back as we refined our kit, developed packaging, and finalized our prototype. Our sales events underperformed, but our in-store and door-to-door sales more than compensated.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
342 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (Ultimately, ReSwipe thrived. We hit strong financial milestones, honoured our CSR commitment, and won Top Pitch at Dragon's Lair. Our final share value reached $89.37, up from $10.00.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (Mission Statement)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 301 0 R
/E (ReSwipe's mission is to provide our community with sustainable, reusable, and reliable cleaning solutions that reduce waste for a better tomorrow. We deliver a practical, all-in-one cleaning package designed for durability, affordability, and real everyday value. Through ethical business practices and a commitment to environmental responsibility, we create dependable value for our shareholders and a cleaner, greener future for everyone we serve.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
