464 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (As the VP of Finance, I maintained and submitted all core JA-required financial sheets. I colour-coded the Weekly Finance Worksheet so that all incoming cash appears in green and all outgoing cash appears in red, allowing any team members to read transactions clearly. I also reimbursed all payables within one week of receiving the receipt, and every purchase was cleared by the next week's entry, resulting in zero outstanding accounts payable at end of JA. Additionally, I designed and built five analytical sheets beyond JA requirements: a Company Valuation summary, a KPI & Financial Ratios sheet, a Weekly Sales & Profit Trend tracker, an Investor Return Calculator, and a Weekly Financial Log.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
