/P 305 0 R
/E (Successes)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
469 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (ReSwipe sold 207 Swipe Kits over 18 active selling weeks, generating $3,169.23 in revenue and a net income of $1,031.84. Break-even was achieved by Week 12, only four weeks into active selling, showing fast and efficient selling. At the start of JA, each shareholder invested $10, by end of the program, each share was valued at $89.37, a return of 794% on the original investment. Peak sales of $730 were recorded in a single week \(Week 16\), with 49 kits sold. All financial records were kept fully balanced, with Total Debits equaling Total Credits at the close of every week.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
470 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (Challenges)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
471 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (While the finance sheets were maintained with precision throughout the program, the sales sheets were disorganized; units sold, number of products on hand, and weekly sales did not align with what was recorded in the financial sheets. I spent several hours going back through physical receipts, going over every transaction on the Weekly Finance Worksheet and the Weekly Banking Record. This extra effort brought all records into complete alignment and ensured the final financials were fully reliable.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
