/P 306 0 R
/E (A key challenge we faced was having a high amount of inventory while our company members started to struggle selling. To overcome this, we introduced the idea of a Golden Ticket initiative, where selected products included a special reward to increase excitement and encourage purchases. Another challenge faced was the inconsistency of the sales sheets with significant mistakes. The sales and finance departments had to work together to fix the sheets to ensure all numbers were correct.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
